00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,227
Hi, I’m Somama Siddiqui.

2
00:00:01,227 --> 00:00:05,521
For my senior seminar at Fisk, I built an
agent that reads an article,

3
00:00:05,521 --> 00:00:08,281
