17
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,997
The excerpt on screen comes from that
message.

18
00:00:44,997 --> 00:00:46,571
The model calls were real.

19
00:00:46,571 --> 00:00:49,717
The mailbox was local, so no email left the
experiment.

20
00:00:50,042 --> 00:00:53,503
Here is the code I used to score the full
